Causal regression test only (do NOT apply to production): revert the 2.1.5
greenlet_spawn guard to the 1.4 behavior, so cancellation bypasses the
greenlet again.  Used to show the guard is what prevents P1.

--- a/sqlalchemy/util/concurrency.py
+++ b/sqlalchemy/util/concurrency.py
@@ -203,7 +203,7 @@
             # wait for a coroutine from await_ and then return its
             # result back to it.
             value = await result
-        except BaseException:
+        except Exception:
             # this allows an exception to be raised within
             # the moderated greenlet so that it can continue
             # its expected flow.
